      "category": "ObjectLibrary",
      "signature": "CreateLibrary(In Base Class, In Has Blueprint Classes, In Use Weak)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Base Class",
          "type": "UClass*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Has Blueprint Classes",
          "type": "Bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Use Weak",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UObjectLibrary*",
      "docs": "Static function to create a new ObjectLibrary at runtime, with various options set\nThere is now a better version of this functionality in AssetManager, if you are creating many game-specific libraries you should switch to using AssetManager instead\n@param\tInBaseClass\t\t\t\tOnly objects of this class can exist in the library\n@param\tbInHasBlueprintClasses\tIf true, this library contains blueprint classes derived from BaseClass, will convert them correctly\n@param\tInUseWeak\t\t\t\tIf true, references to objects are weak, so they can be garbage collected. Useful in the editor to allow deletion"
    },
